[33.106079, "o", "  window 3 (3s): victim  87.4%  attacker  12.3%\r\n\r\n== scx_qmap while running ==\r\nroot/ops: qmap\r\nstats  : enq=293 dsp=293 delta=0 reenq=93 deq=0 core=0 enq_ddsp=2008 pidw=417\r\n"]
[33.12173, "o", "EXIT: unregistered from user space\r\n"]
[33.128676, "o", "state after: disabled  map after: removed\r\n\r\n== result (mean of 3 x 3s windows per phase) ==\r\n| phase | attacker weight | victim CPU% | attacker CPU% | victim model % |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| baseline | 100 | 49.9 | 50.0 | 50.0 |\r\n| attack | 2000 | 4.1 | 95.9 | 4.8 |\r\n"]
